  "html": "<ul><li><strong>Projects list</strong>: Kanban (Not Started/In Progress/On Hold/Completed) / Table toggle; cards (title, client, dates, owner, linked proposal, progress %); Export · + Add Project. Many &quot;Onboarding, &lt;client&gt;&quot; / &quot;Group, &lt;group&gt;&quot; projects.</li><li><strong>Add Project</strong>: Project Details (Title, Client, Owner, Budget Hours, Budget Amount, Service Line, Linked Proposal, description, doc upload) + Pricing &amp; Billing (Billable toggle → Pricing Method, Price, Tax rate, Billing Type, Billing On).</li><li><strong>Project Details</strong>: summary (status + On Track; budget burn-down); tabs <strong>Tasks/Jobs</strong> (Kanban Planned/To Do/In Progress/Waiting) · <strong>Client Request</strong> · <strong>Time Tracking</strong>.</li><li><strong>Add Task/Job</strong>: branches: Internal Task (Billable toggle; assignee/reviewer/status/priority/due/estimate/checklist) · Client Request (Request Type + Client Assignee; Save as draft/Send now; dependent task) · Add Job (name, assignee, auto Job Code). Client locked to the project's client.</li><li><strong>Client Request</strong> drawer (status, dates, progress; Cancel request / Extend due date / Send reminder). Confirms <strong>Client → Project → Job → Task</strong> hierarchy.</li></ul>",
