 "l-sc-2": {
  "md": "Tabs Booking View / My Bookings. **\"Your Booking Links\"** list (name · N Booked · duration · In-Person/Online · timezone). Each link's public URL = **`prac.soleapp.com.au/booking/<slug>`**.\n- **Edit Booking Link** drawer: Basic Details (title, slug, duration, timezone, **Deal Status** [ties the booking to the Deals pipeline, e.g. \"New Enquiry\"], buffer time, client entity) → **Meeting Setup** (Meeting Type, Platform e.g. **Google Meet** auto-link, Select Calendar) → **Availability** (weekday toggles + per-day time ranges).\n- **Booking Settings** drawer: org-wide defaults (default duration, buffer, timezone, default availability days/times) applied to new links.\n- **New Booking Link** = a **3-step wizard** (Booking Info → Meeting Setup → Availability) with a \"Use Default Settings\" shortcut → **Create Booking Link**.\n- A booking **auto-creates a \"New Enquiry\" deal** in Deals (see the Deals \"Sole Link booking\" banner).",
  "html": "<p>Tabs Booking View / My Bookings. <strong>&quot;Your Booking Links&quot;</strong> list (name · N Booked · duration · In-Person/Online · timezone). Each link's public URL = <strong><code>prac.soleapp.com.au/booking/&lt;slug&gt;</code></strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>Edit Booking Link</strong> drawer: Basic Details (title, slug, duration, timezone, <strong>Deal Status</strong> [ties the booking to the Deals pipeline, e.g. &quot;New Enquiry&quot;], buffer time, client entity) → <strong>Meeting Setup</strong> (Meeting Type, Platform e.g. <strong>Google Meet</strong> auto-link, Select Calendar) → <strong>Availability</strong> (weekday toggles + per-day time ranges).</li><li><strong>Booking Settings</strong> drawer: org-wide defaults (default duration, buffer, timezone, default availability days/times) applied to new links.</li><li><strong>New Booking Link</strong> = a <strong>3-step wizard</strong> (Booking Info → Meeting Setup → Availability) with a &quot;Use Default Settings&quot; shortcut → <strong>Create Booking Link</strong>.</li><li>A booking <strong>auto-creates a &quot;New Enquiry&quot; deal</strong> in Deals (see the Deals &quot;Sole Link booking&quot; banner).</li></ul>",
  "checkedAt": "2026-07-24",
  "reviewDays": 90,
  "owner": "",
  "source": "SPM knowledge base, Part E"
 },
